// The PiPL is what tells Photoshop this DLL is a plug-in, what kind it is and
// where its entry point is. Newer Photoshop reads it straight from a JSON
// resource, so no separate PiPL compiler is involved -- rc.exe embeds the file
// as it stands and Photoshop parses it at load time.
JSON_PIPL JSON "PiPLs.json"
